# Scenario 025 — Charity safeguarding intake, driven the way the script tells an
# operator to drive it: every command on its own, answering Arturo's questions.
#
# /staff proposes a model-generated plan, so the number of Workers varies; the
# @staff directive answers the per-Worker review until the plan is applied.
